  description: Moves water or gas (not lava) from behind it to where its spout points, 2 cells a second. It reaches 8 cells back and pushes up to 8 cells ahead, so it drains a flooded shaft from above and lifts water up one. Fluid can't pass through it; ants can. R turns it.
